# Local-only, Tools & Logs
# Glob, not `keys.json`: the free/Pro split adds keys.free.json and
# keys.pro.json, and the Pro one carries the Sophtron credentials. Committing
# it once is unrecoverable — the value stays in the git objects forever.
keys*.json
!keys.example.json
.env
*.log

